{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1064001001:0":{"text":"唔……<key:dialog64>","source_cn":"唔……<key:dialog64>","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x16ADADC6BAFAD984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064001002:1":{"text":"莱欧斯！你终于醒了！","source_cn":"莱欧斯！你终于醒了！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x629D551451BE71D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064001003:1":{"text":"玛露西尔、齐尔查克、森……呃？森西呢？","source_cn":"玛露西尔、齐尔查克、森……呃？森西呢？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC5B9402B29287F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064001004:1":{"text":"森西晕传送，正在一旁休息。","source_cn":"森西晕传送，正在一旁休息。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xCEC233DF66F36C01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064001005:1":{"text":"我们似乎在迷宫里被传送出来了。","source_cn":"我们似乎在迷宫里被传送出来了。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x270D75194005D00D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064001006:1":{"text":"所以，这里是……？","source_cn":"所以，这里是……？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x979634A0BCCB8BF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064001007:1":{"text":"你好，我是漫漫。这里是伊索米亚。","source_cn":"你好，我是漫漫。这里是伊索米亚。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xF94679DB350208ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064001008:1":{"text":"等等——会说话的仓鼠魔物？","source_cn":"等等——会说话的仓鼠魔物？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xAA7E78EFD812A862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064001009:1":{"text":"……他们是使魔啦！","source_cn":"……他们是使魔啦！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xBE56B90F85A33204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064001010:1":{"text":"满满和漫漫是强大的魔法师——也就是我们那里被称为魔术师...","source_cn":"满满和漫漫是强大的魔法师——也就是我们那里被称为魔术师...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064001011:1":{"text":"玛露西尔小姐说得没错！我们的主人正是伊索米亚最强大的魔...","source_cn":"玛露西尔小姐说得没错！我们的主人正是伊索米亚最强大的魔...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064001012:1":{"text":"完全没听说过……","source_cn":"完全没听说过……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xC87A5BDEF55E37DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064001013:1":{"text":"老……呕……","source_cn":"老……呕……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x9E1B6F42FF0573C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064001014:1":{"text":"这位森西先生看起来状态不是很好，先跟我们回神秘屋治疗一下吧。","source_cn":"这位森西先生看起来状态不是很好，先跟我们回神秘屋治疗一下吧。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x7461B5B521238BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064001015:1":{"text":"有办法治疗吗？那就拜托你们了。","source_cn":"有办法治疗吗？那就拜托你们了。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x25E57CBBDC3AF367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064001016:0":{"text":"等等，还是没有人跟我解释清楚状况啊！别走啊——","source_cn":"等等，还是没有人跟我解释清楚状况啊！别走啊——","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x3D8528EFF16B50B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:30:1064001017:1":{"text":"漫漫和满满带着玛露西尔一行人返回了神秘屋……","source_cn":"漫漫和满满带着玛露西尔一行人返回了神秘屋……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xCC56AC51449DC902","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064001018:1":{"text":"梅林，梅林——快来帮帮忙！","source_cn":"梅林，梅林——快来帮帮忙！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x538342A1AA6BFE7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064001019:1":{"text":"这位森西先生晕传送晕得很厉害！","source_cn":"这位森西先生晕传送晕得很厉害！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xE343064C7DBBEB26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064001020:1":{"text":"森西是矮人，是很容易晕传送的体质……","source_cn":"森西是矮人，是很容易晕传送的体质……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x19D3E1BC3580AF05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064001021:1":{"text":"啊，忘记自我介绍了。梅林<male>先生</male>...","source_cn":"啊，忘记自我介绍了。梅林<male>先生</male>...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:37:1064001021":{"text":"啊，忘记自我介绍了。梅林<male>先生</male><female>女士</female>，我是玛露西尔，也是一名魔法师。","source_cn":"啊，忘记自我介绍了。梅林<male>先生</male><female>女士</female>，我是玛露西尔，也是一名魔法师。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xE994AB8C6FA2B556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064001022:1":{"text":"我也来一起帮忙吧！","source_cn":"我也来一起帮忙吧！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xD949DEBF7A921833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064001023:1":{"text":"不……要……呃……","source_cn":"不……要……呃……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x152D35E755171AAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1064001023":{"text":"不……要……呃……","source_cn":"不……要……呃……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x152D35E755171AAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:43:1064001024:1":{"text":"在你们的治疗下，森西慢慢恢复了一些。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_legacy_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:44:1064001025:0":{"text":"莱欧斯、玛露西尔、齐尔查克和森西也在满满和漫漫的热情说...","source_cn":"莱欧斯、玛露西尔、齐尔查克和森西也在满满和漫漫的热情说...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:45:1064001026:0":{"text":"你也得知了他们是来自于另一个世界的冒险者。他们在迷宫中...","source_cn":"你也得知了他们是来自于另一个世界的冒险者。他们在迷宫中...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:46:1064001027:1":{"text":"在成功“复活”法琳后，却遭遇了迷宫之主，被迫再度与法琳分开。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_legacy_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:47:1064001028:1":{"text":"随后，他们在变化中的迷宫迷失了方向，并遭遇了一个从未见识和听闻的魔物。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_legacy_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:48:1064001029:1":{"text":"与它战斗后，所有人都晕了过去，再次醒来就身处于伊索米亚了。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_legacy_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064001030:1":{"text":"好曲折的冒险！满满听着都觉得辛苦……","source_cn":"好曲折的冒险！满满听着都觉得辛苦……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x8417DFDDC0F9EEB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064001031:0":{"text":"是有点辛苦了，但也品尝到了很多不同风味的魔物。","source_cn":"是有点辛苦了，但也品尝到了很多不同风味的魔物。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5D2C61DDA5AC4B32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064001032:1":{"text":"……吃魔物？！呜哇，你们不会、不会吃满满吧？！","source_cn":"……吃魔物？！呜哇，你们不会、不会吃满满吧？！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB3FB8FB1D3861FDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064001033:0":{"text":"咕——","source_cn":"咕——","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x50227C51D4BBA586","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064001034:0":{"text":"莱欧斯！不要吓人啦！还有，你的肚子叫得太大声了——","source_cn":"莱欧斯！不要吓人啦！还有，你的肚子叫得太大声了——","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xD54356F65584482B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064001035:1":{"text":"别担心，满满！我们可不是什么魔物都吃的，我们会挑选对象的。","source_cn":"别担心，满满！我们可不是什么魔物都吃的，我们会挑选对象的。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x9D56E917C8DD67A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064001036:1":{"text":"……那算是圆场吗？","source